Description: Pars Linux boot and system repair tool
 Pars Linux Boot Repair provides graphical and automated tools to repair
 damaged GRUB and EFI bootloaders, perform filesystem checks (ext4, btrfs),
 chroot into installed rootfs systems, reset user passwords, and fix
 broken APT packages.
